# Menu_MoveCursor: the cursor clamps (ruling 5, 2), at its first call (the options screen: d1 = the
# last item, 2, for Tbl_049994). up_at_top: Up newly pressed on pad 1 ($F626 bit 0) with the
# cursor ($F3B4) at 0: stays 0. down_at_bottom: Down (bit 1) at item 2: stays 2. Real states: the
# player pressing Up on the first option or Down on the last; scenario-options never does.

case up_at_top
w $FFFFF3B4 = 0
b $FFFFF626 = $01

case down_at_bottom
w $FFFFF3B4 = 2
reg d1 = 2
b $FFFFF626 = $02
